<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classBinaryConversions" kindref="compound">BinaryConversions</ref> static class is a utility used to 1.) Convert between a Base64 std::string and an std::vector&lt;uint8_t&gt; byte string. 2.) Convert between a Hex std::string and an std::vector&lt;uint8_t&gt; byte string. </para>
</sect1>
